[14.981337, "o", "\u001b[H                                                                                                    \r\r\n● Disk is at \u001b[;1m91%\u001b[0m and 6 Homebrew packages are outdated. Updating first.                              \r\r\n                                                                                                    \r\r\n● Step(brew)  omega_space() { df -Pk \"$(if [ -d /System/Volumes/Data ]; then echo /System/Volum…    \r\r\n  └  ✓ · 4s · 6 lines  (ctrl+o)                                                                     \r\r\n                                                                                                    \r\r\n● Step(pipx)  pipx upgrade-all                                                                      \r\r\n  └  ✗ exit 1 · 4s · 4 lines                                                                        \r\r\n     Upgrading httpie...                                                                            \r\r\n     Error: python@3.12 is not installed                                                            \r\r\n       The interpreter for 4 venvs no longer exists.                                                \r\r\n     Error upgrading 4 packages                                                                     \r\r\n\r\n▸ ● Step(npm)  npm update -g                                                                        \r\r\n  └  ✓ · 3s · 1 line  (ctrl+o)                                                                      \r\r\n                                                                                                    \r\r\n● \u001b[;m\u001b[0m\u001b[;m\u001b[0m\u001b[;m pipx \u001b[0m failed because its environments still point at \u001b[;1mPython 3.12\u001b[0m, which Homebrew replaced        \r\r\n  with 3.13. Reinstalling them fixes it.                                                            \r\r\n                                                                           