[14.98141, "o", "───────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\r\r\n│ ⚠ Run this?  risk: dangerous                                                                     │\r\r\n│                                                                                                  │\r\r\n│ Bash(pipx reinstall-all --python python3.13)                                                     │\r\r\n│                                                                                                  │\r\r\n│ Rebuild the pipx environments against the current Homebrew Python                                │\r\r\n│                                                                                                  │\r\r\n│ y yes · a yes to all · n no                                                                      │\r\r\n│ enter does not approve a dangerous command                                                       │\r\r\n╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\r\r\n » asks before risky actions (shift+tab)            claude-haiku-5-5 · ↑29.5k ↓1.5k · $0.0037 · 15s\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[31;H"]
[15.498871, "o", "\u001b[H● \u001b[;m\u001b[0m\u001b[;m\u001b[0m\u001b[;m pipx \u001b[0m failed because its environments still point at \u001b[;1mPython 3.12\u001b[0m, which Homebrew replaced        \r\r\n  with 3.13. Reinstalling them fixes it.                                                            \r\r\n\r\n╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\r\r\n│ Commands                                                                                         │\r\r\n│   /help                      Show commands and keyboard shortcuts                                │\r\r\n│   /mode [ask|auto|readonly]  Change the approval mode                                            │\r\r\n│   /model [name]              Switch the model from the next turn                                 │\r\r\n│   /exit                      End the session and quit                                            │\r\r\n│   /full /update /clean /analyze /health /tune /dev /install /docker /fix /history /doctor        │\r\r\n│   /disk /logs /shell /steps /models /settings /notes                                             │\r\r\n│                              Start another task in this session                                  │\r\r\n│ Keyboard shortcuts                                                                               │\r\r\n│   ctrl+f          Search the transcript                                                          │\r\r\n│   shift+tab       Cycle the approval mode                                                        │\r\r\n│   ctrl+p          Switch to the next model (also alt+p)                                          │\r\r\n│   ctrl+o /expand  Expand or collapse tool output                                                 │\r\r\n│   ctrl+b /panel   Show or hide the session panel                                                 │\r\r\n│   ctrl+y          Copy the focused tool output                                                   │\r\r\n│   alt+up/down     Focus the previous or next tool                                                │\r\r\n│   /               Open the command menu                                                          │\r\r\n│   tab             Complete the highlighted command                                               │\r\r\n│   y / n / a       Approve, deny, or approve the rest                                             │\r\r\n│   esc             Clear the line; press again to quit                                            │\r\r\n│   ctrl+c          Cancel the run                                                                 │\r\r\n│   ↑↓ home/end g G Scroll the transcript                                                          │\r\r\n│   pgup/pgdown     Scroll the transcript while a card is open                                     │\r\r\n│   shift+drag      Select text (OMEGA_MOUSE=0 leaves the mouse to the terminal)                   │\r\r\n\r\n\r\n  ?/esc close help · ↑↓ scroll\u001b[K\u001b[31;H"]
